{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play through windows</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag and drop windows to explore the world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373000/extras/13ae5dd335cc5f73b8df67f53f42a52d.avif?t=1767286471\" width=767 height=332 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open multiple windows for interaction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each window contains its own distinct gameplay content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters can traverse windows to travel between different window worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize various mechanics to create unique differences between each window's world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Employ a multi-window, multi-game mindset to solve puzzles and find exits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373000/extras/2da8752b60b4c59d985350b72ad36b38.avif?t=1767286471\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373000/extras_big/2da8752b60b4c59d985350b72ad36b38.webp?t=1767286471 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was built using Unity (which lacks native window creation) and employs numerous incredible techniques to deliver an absolutely unique gaming experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add it to your wishlist now\u2014the full version is in development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Note: The current demo is an early build and differs significantly from the screenshots shown here. A new demo will be released with a proper update.)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3373000?t=1767286471","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3373000?t=1767286471","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373000/350bc5b4f939b8b83f2ae432eb72c0584af91635/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767286471","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373000/350bc5b4f939b8b83f2ae432eb72c0584af91635/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767286471","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3422560,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play through windows</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag and drop windows to explore the world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373000/extras/13ae5dd335cc5f73b8df67f53f42a52d.avif?t=1767286471\" width=767 height=332 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open multiple windows for interaction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each window contains its own distinct gameplay content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters can traverse windows to travel between different window worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize various mechanics to create unique differences between each window's world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Employ a multi-window, multi-game mindset to solve puzzles and find exits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373000/extras/2da8752b60b4c59d985350b72ad36b38.avif?t=1767286471\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373000/extras_big/2da8752b60b4c59d985350b72ad36b38.webp?t=1767286471 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was built using Unity (which lacks native window creation) and employs numerous incredible techniques t